WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Patch Audit checks completed code changes. This public site replays saved evidence only.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Open the retained Boltons example. The source, patch and results come from a real saved record.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The selected ordinary test suite passed 155 tests. That is the scope of this test result.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
