00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:41.000
The patch changed dictutils.py but missed the standalone implementation in urlutils.py. Empty input reported length one instead of zero: one incomplete repair.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Inspect the retained observations, exact patch and evidence. Viewing this saved record does not run the patch again.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:03.000
